OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon calls for corporate
OL,4,Ahomicide probe over claims patients
OL,5,Aunnecessarily bled to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FA consultant surgeon at Aberdeen Royal
OL,8,FInfirmary has called for a corporate
OL,9,Fhomicide investigation into claims of
OL,10,Favoidable deaths among NHS Grampian
OL,11,Fpatients over many years.
OL,13,FDr Mohammed Habib, who is still a
OL,14,Fsurgeon at the hospital, said he had
OL,15,Fbeen raising concerns for a decade,
OL,16,Fincluding with government ministers and
OL,17,Fpolice but he had been ignored.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
